    {
      "body": "The MI355 V1 Attention Shard 2/4 failure (`test_chunked_context_backend_correctness[...glm...ROCM_AITER_FA]`) is unrelated to this PR. It also fails on main (build 97866). No vLLM PR caused it. The runtime-shard plan is rebuilt from main timings, and the latest one put 286 `test_backend_correctness` cases ahead of this test in the same process. Those cases move the CUDA RNG, so the GLM case got a random draw where a bf16 SDPA reference and the bf16 kernel differ by slightly more than `atol=1e-2`. Fix: #64259.\n",
